  "limitations": [
    "Twelve targets, declared in a config to span the modality contrast rather than sampled from anything.",
    "The borderline band is wide once measurement spread is propagated, so the gate separates clear negatives from everything else rather than sorting the middle.",
    "No validation against measured macrocycle binding exists, because no such labelled set exists. Clinical modality is a proxy and a loose one, which is why each label names its agent.",
    "A target whose declared ranges are two -- the nsp10/nsp16 interface -- is measured on the first, so its row is about one chain and not the interface."
  ],
